<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month BUBOR rate falls to 20.79 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month BUBOR rate falls to 20.79 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) dropped one basis point for the one-month maturity on Thursday, while the three- and six-month rates remained steady, the National Bank of Hungary said on its BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 20.79 percent, the three-month rate at 20.90 percent, while the six-month rate was fixed at 21.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
